          "text": "🚨 LIVE CLAUDE WORKSHOP 🚨\n\nSales teams, pay attention.\n\nMost teams already have the stack: CRM, call recorder, notetaker, prospecting tool, forecasting platform.\n\nWhat they don’t have is time back.\n\nEvery one of those tools captures information.\n\nNone of them do the work — the follow‑up still gets typed by hand, the prep still happens the night before, the CRM still gets updated manually.\n\nJai Easton and I are building a Claude‑powered deal assistant, start to finish, in one hour:\n✅ remembers every call automatically — nobody’s guessing what they told which prospect\n✅ briefs reps before the call: context, risks, the exact questions to ask\n✅ writes the follow‑up and updates the CRM after — no manual entry\n✅ zero new dashboards for reps to check\n\nWe build the whole thing in Claude Desktop while you watch, and you leave with the prompts, the file structure, and the full recording.\n\nStay to the end and grab one of a limited number of free 30‑minute working sessions. We’ll help you set it up for your own team.\n\n📅 Friday, August 14 · 12–1pm PT / 3–4pm ET  \n🔗 Register free: https://luma.com/hwrbxq4w",
          "type": "post",
