          "repostText": "GreenChain, the winning team in our K2 Think V2 demo series at HackPrinceton, tackles a simple but hard problem: sustainable procurement shouldn’t be guesswork. 🪴\n\nTheir project uses K2 Think V2 to compare real manufacturers and surface lower-carbon options, turning complex supply-chain changes into scenarios the model can reason over. \n\nWatch the demo below to see how they made sustainability a first-class constraint in procurement, not an afterthought.",
          "repostUrl": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/institute-of-foundation-models_greenchain-the-winning-team-in-our-k2-think-activity-7484007819382304769-RBSi",
