            "showContributionExperience": false,
            "showSocialDetail": true
          },
          "text": "Excited to share that our project, GreenChain, was featured by Institute of Foundation Models as part of its hackathon series!\n\nYou no longer need a closed frontier model to ship something real. An open reasoning model paired with the right agent setup was enough to turn a pile of shipping and emissions data into actionable recommendations in minutes, not months.",
